        "metadata": {
          "media": {
            "duration": 2388,
            "fileSize": 38651494
          },
          "description": "Enjoy a hand-picked selection of songs from my third album, 𝘈𝘯 𝘌𝘣𝘰𝘯𝘺 & 𝘐𝘷𝘰𝘳𝘺 𝘊𝘩𝘳𝘪𝘴𝘵𝘮𝘢𝘴. Featured here is my original song “Christmas Mourning,” which I wrote to honor those who may find the season challenging or are mourning, and to celebrate the hope the Savior can bring us no matter our circumstances. With soul-filled, inspiring arrangements of classic Christmas songs, I hope this collection invites you to feel the comfort, joy, and true meaning of this season!",
